    "title": "Broken collarbones and cracked knees: Aaron Rodgers' surprising take on his NFL durability - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sports Staff, cleveland.com ,\n5 hours ago CLEVELAND, Ohio — When you think of the most durable quarterbacks in NFL history, iron men like Brett Favre or Tom Brady might come to mind. Yet quietly, despite holding the dubious distinction of being the most-sacked quarterback in NFL history, Aaron Rodgers has demonstrated remarkable staying power throughout his career. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
